InsightDock Charts for C++
=====================================

This project bundles or references the following third-party components:

stb_truetype.h / stb_image_write.h
  Public domain / MIT (see LICENSES/stb.txt and third_party/ headers)

stb_image.h (tests/third_party/, used only by the test suite, never shipped)
  Public domain / MIT

Embedded font subsets (include/insightdock/embedded_font.h and embedded_font_latin.h)
  DejaVu Sans, subsetted to printable ASCII (U+0020-U+007E), or optionally
  ASCII plus Latin-1 and Latin Extended-A, with fonttools' pyftsubset
  (regeneration commands in the headers' comments). DejaVu Sans is
  derived from Bitstream Vera and distributed under a permissive license that
  explicitly allows embedding, redistribution, and modification (including
  subsetting). The copyright, trademark and permission notices are included
  in LICENSES/Bitstream-Vera.txt and installed with the library. See
  https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html.

PoDoFo (optional PDF backend)
  Not vendored. External dependency when INSIGHTDOCK_WITH_PODOFO=ON.
  See https://github.com/podofo/podofo for license terms.
